         | make-withdraw: ...                              |
global ->| W2: ---------------------------+                |
env      | W1: --+                        |                |
         +-------|------------------------|----------------+
                 |              ^         |              ^
                 |              |         |              |
                 |       +------+------+  |       +------+-------+
                 |  E1 ->| balance: 50 |  |  E2 ->| balance: 100 |
                 |       +-------------+  |       +--------------+
                 V              ^         V              ^
             .---.---.          |     .---.---.          |
             | O | O-+----------+     | O | O-+----------+
             `-|-^---'                `-|-^---'
               | +----------------------+
               V V
        parameters: amount
        body: ...
@end example
@end ifinfo
